data: {"id": "ab6c596c405b4ebd-thinking-parallel_evidence-870", "run_id": "ab6c596c405b4ebd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实（来自实时工具）：\n- Pod `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` (`uid=705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee`) 在 `node2` 上处于 `Running` 状态，`READY=0/1`，`RESTARTS=0`，`IP=172.16.104.16`。\n- `kubectl describe` 明确显示持续触发 `Readiness probe failed`：`connection refused` (TCP 8080 拒绝连接) 以及 `HTTP status 503`。\n- Topology 确认该 Pod 无匹配 Service、Owner 为 ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45`。\n\n因果分析：\n- **NotReady 根因证据确凿**：Pod 的容器进程未在 8080 端口监听，导致 kubelet Readiness 探针反复失败（`connection refused` 或 `503`），这是当前 `READY=0/1` 的直接原因。\n- 重启次数为 0 排除了因", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789088706163, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

